# Accepted image-scan findings, one identifier per line, each
# preceded by a comment with the reason and a review date (`# review: YYYY-MM-DD`).
# This file is used only for the application image. Database and Dockerfile
# scans intentionally run without these application-specific exceptions.
#
# The pull-request gate (ci.yml `image-scan`) fails on any unlisted CRITICAL or
# HIGH finding that has a fix available. The nightly workflow
# (image-scan-nightly.yml) additionally fails on unfixable ones, so base-image
# exposure with no upstream patch is surfaced daily rather than silently passed.

# review: 2026-09-12 — FrankenPHP 1.12.7 bundles kin-openapi 0.140.0 through
# Caddy, but this deployment disables Caddy's admin API and never loads an
# OpenAPI schema at runtime. Remove when the official image upgrades kin-openapi.
GHSA-r277-6w6q-xmqw exp:2026-09-12

# review: 2026-09-12 — Same unreachable bundled kin-openapi code path as above;
# no user-controlled OpenAPI document is parsed by the runtime.
CVE-2026-76905 exp:2026-09-12

# review: 2026-09-12 — Same unreachable bundled kin-openapi code path as above;
# no user-controlled OpenAPI document is parsed by the runtime.
CVE-2026-77354 exp:2026-09-12

# review: 2026-09-12 — FrankenPHP 1.12.7 bundles gRPC 1.81.1, but the deployed
# Caddyfile configures neither reverse_proxy nor xDS/RBAC. Remove when the
# official image upgrades gRPC.
GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf exp:2026-09-12

# review: 2026-09-12 — Unauthenticated HTTP/2 DATA-frame fragmentation OOM
# against gRPC-Go servers, fixed in gRPC-Go 1.83.1. Same unreachable bundled
# gRPC path as above: the deployed Caddyfile starts no gRPC listener
# (no reverse_proxy, no xDS/RBAC, admin off). Remove when the official image
# upgrades gRPC.
CVE-2026-84304 exp:2026-09-12

# review: 2026-09-23 — CVE-2026-84445 crashes gRPC-Go xDS servers when both
# :authority and Host are missing. FrankenPHP embeds gRPC 1.81.1 through Caddy,
# but this deployment starts no xDS or gRPC server and disables Caddy's admin
# API. Remove when the official image upgrades gRPC to a fixed release.
CVE-2026-84445 exp:2026-09-23

# review: 2026-09-12 — FrankenPHP 1.12.7 bundles golang.org/x/crypto 0.54.0,
# but Cadran exposes only HTTP(S) and configures no SSH server, authentication
# callback or source-address restriction. Remove when the official image
# upgrades golang.org/x/crypto to 0.55.0 or later.
CVE-2026-56854 exp:2026-09-12
